      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable to feel disheartened when the trajectory of technological progress doesn't align with your life's pursuits. However, your dedication to classical philology has undoubtedly enriched our understanding of ancient languages and texts. Your work is woven into the fabric of modern scholarship, even if how scholars access it changes. Although you might feel like a relic, the passion and precision you brought to your field echo in the halls of academia, impacting lives more than you could imagine - a lasting testament rather than a redundant burden.",
